  V('Use the right word',stem('The distance is ___ because the total travel is ___.')+stem('The displacement is ___ because the finish is ___ from the start.'),W([['Trace','Distance follows the whole path.'],['Connect','Displacement joins start to finish.']]),'Put it in words')
